{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123788","id":4622370477,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE4PGrQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123788","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123788.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123788.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123788","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123788/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123788/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123788/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/47219ab6172d24bc8e9bde55c9a85ab54fcce21c","number":123788,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize Dictionary `get` and `get_or_add`","user":{"login":"aurpine","id":12262539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYyNTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12262539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine","html_url":"https://github.com/aurpine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aurpine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Micro-optimize `Dictionary` `get` and `get_or_add`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`Dictionary::get` and `Dictionary::get_or_add` both call `Dictionary::getptr` which performs an additional redundant type check/conversion. This can be expensive for script typed Dictionaries with long inheritance chains.\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Testing code</summary>\r\n\r\nPut in `tests/core/test_containers.cpp`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#include \"tests/test_macros.h\"\r\n\r\nTEST_FORCE_LINK(test_containers)\r\n\r\n#include <chrono>\r\n#include <cstdio>\r\n#include \"core/object/ref_counted.h\"\r\n\r\nclass CustomObject : public RefCounted {\r\n\tGDCLASS(CustomObject, RefCounted);\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst int SCENARIOS = 4;\r\n\r\nnamespace DictionaryTests {\r\nvoid setup(Dictionary &d, Variant &v, int scenario) {\r\n\tswitch(scenario) {\r\n\t\t// int, untyped\r\n\t\tcase 0:\r\n\t\t\tv = 1;\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t// object (refcounted), untyped\r\n\t\tcase 1:\r\n\t\t\tv = memnew(CustomObject);\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t// int, mismatch\r\n\t\tcase 2:\r\n\t\t\tv = 1.1;\r\n\t\t\td.set_typed(Variant::INT, StringName(), Variant(), Variant::INT, StringName(), Variant());\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t// object (refcounted), typed\r\n\t\tcase 3:\r\n\t\t\tv = memnew(CustomObject);\r\n\t\t\td.set_typed(Variant::OBJECT, v.operator Object *()->get_class_name(), v.operator Object *()->get_script(), Variant::INT, StringName(), Variant());\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n\r\n__attribute__((optimize(\"O0\")))\r\ndouble getptr(int scenario) {\r\n\tDictionary d;\r\n\tVariant v;\r\n\tsetup(d, v, scenario);\r\n\tconst int N = 100'000'000;\r\n\r\n\tauto start = std::chrono::steady_clock::now();\r\n\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\r\n\t\tconst Variant *x = d.getptr(v);\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tdouble ret = std::chrono::duration<double, std::nano>(std::chrono::steady_clock::now() - start).count() / N;\r\n\r\n\tprintf(\"%.2lf\\n\", ret);\r\n\tfflush(stdout);\r\n\r\n\treturn ret;\r\n}\r\n\r\n__attribute__((optimize(\"O0\")))\r\ndouble get(int scenario) {\r\n\tDictionary d;\r\n\tVariant v;\r\n\tsetup(d, v, scenario);\r\n\tVariant w(0);\r\n\tconst int N = 100'000'000;\r\n\r\n\tauto start = std::chrono::steady_clock::now();\r\n\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\r\n\t\td.get(v, w);\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tdouble ret = std::chrono::duration<double, std::nano>(std::chrono::steady_clock::now() - start).count() / N;\r\n\r\n\tprintf(\"%.2lf\\n\", ret);\r\n\tfflush(stdout);\r\n\r\n\treturn ret;\r\n}\r\n\r\ndouble get_or_add(int scenario) {\r\n\tDictionary d;\r\n\tVariant v;\r\n\tVariant w(0);\r\n\tsetup(d, v, scenario);\r\n\tconst int N = 100'000'000;\r\n\r\n\tauto start = std::chrono::steady_clock::now();\r\n\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < N; i++) {\r\n\t\td.get_or_add(v, w);\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tdouble ret = std::chrono::duration<double, std::nano>(std::chrono::steady_clock::now() - start).count() / N;\r\n\r\n\tprintf(\"%.2lf\\n\", ret);\r\n\tfflush(stdout);\r\n\r\n\treturn ret;\r\n}\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\nstatic void containers() {\r\n\t// Times to run each test.\r\n\tconst int N = 3;\r\n\r\n\tLocalVector<double> data[SCENARIOS][N];\r\n\r\n#define run_loop(test) printf(#test\"\\n\");\\\r\n\tfor (int n = 0; n < N; n++) {\\\r\n\t\tdata[s][n].push_back(test(s));\\\r\n\t}\\\r\n\r\n\tfor (int s = 0; s < SCENARIOS; s++) {\r\n\t\tprintf(\"SCENARIO %c\\n\", 'A' + s);\r\n\t\tputs(\"=====\");\r\n\t\trun_loop(DictionaryTests::getptr);\r\n\t\trun_loop(DictionaryTests::get);\r\n\t\trun_loop(DictionaryTests::get_or_add);\r\n\r\n\t\tprintf(\"\\n\\n\");\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t// Print csv-like output\r\n\tfor (int s = 0; s < SCENARIOS; s++) {\r\n\t\tprintf(\"SCENARIO %c\\n\", 'A' + s);\r\n\r\n\t\tfor (unsigned int n = 0; n < N; n++) {\r\n\t\t\tfor (unsigned int i = 0; i < data[s][n].size(); i++) {\r\n\t\t\t\tprintf(\"%.2lf%c\", data[s][n][i], i == data[s][n].size() - 1 ? '\\n' : ',');\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\tfflush(stdout);\r\n}\r\n\r\nREGISTER_TEST_COMMAND(\"containers\", &containers)\r\n```\r\n\r\nRun with `./bin/godot...exe --test containers`\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Specs and test setup</summary>\r\nCPU: AMD 9800X3D, GPU: AMD RX 6800, RAM: 32GB 6400 CL28\r\n\r\nWindows 11, Release templates built with GCC (MinGW)\r\n\r\nEach run of the test runs each function loop 3x on all scenarios. Both versions were run 6 times and the 18 results were aggregated by 20th percentile. `N=100_000_000`.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n`getptr` performance should not change but is left in results for comparison. `A`, `B` and `C` should see near no difference since we only save one comparison. Scenario `D` is where the expensive checks show up.\r\n### A: Int untyped\r\n\r\n| Function | Master (ns/op) | PR (ns/op) | Diff | Speedup |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `getptr` | 1.28 | 1.28 | 0 | 1x |\r\n| `get` | 2.51 | 2.45 | -0.06 | 1.02x |\r\n| `get_or_add` | 6.82 | 6.17 | -0.65 | 1.1x |\r\n\r\n### B: RefCounted untyped\r\n\r\n| Function | Master (ns/op) | PR (ns/op) | Diff | Speedup |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `getptr` | 1.28 | 1.28 | 0 | 1x |\r\n| `get` | 2.49 | 2.44 | -0.05 | 1.02x |\r\n| `get_or_add` | 14.47 | 14.61 | +0.15 | 0.99x |\r\n\r\n### C: Int typed (Float conversion)\r\n\r\n| Function | Master (ns/op) | PR (ns/op) | Diff | Speedup |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `getptr` | 8.27 | 8.27 | 0 | 1x |\r\n| `get` | 9.53 | 9.44 | -0.09 | 1.01x |\r\n| `get_or_add` | 13.34 | 12.55 | -0.79 | 1.06x |\r\n\r\n### D: RefCounted typed\r\n\r\n| Function | Master (ns/op) | PR (ns/op) | Diff | Speedup |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `getptr` | 3.85 | 3.85 | 0 | 1x |\r\n| `get` | 7.70 | 5.01 | -2.69 | 1.54x |\r\n| `get_or_add` | 17.70 | 16.16 | -1.54 | 1.10x |\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription